 over 60% of stocks. A very small group of people (or algorithms) control all of that activity. The rest is owned by foreigners (20-30%) and \u201chigh net worth individuals\u201d (The 1%). This is Centralized Control. ", "last_comment_created": 1794149988794, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 1, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 8, "score_up": 26, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"description": "For more than two decades, passive investing has been a humble idea successfully marketed to the retail audience. It was a set-and-forget approach \u2013 not trying to outsmart the market but simply owning it. Now, according to a growing camp...", "large_image": "c7vtLe4ILTfCaRTa.png", "title": "Passive Funds Crossed $2.6 Trillion\u2014Here Is The Percentage That Breaks The Market"}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2118938407296454836", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1AToZ4OCST", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 121, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "nsfcucks", "id": 8929905, "raw_content": "", "author": "Kimball_Kinnison", "created": 1794112318025, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Nom_de_pede", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/nighttimemedia/status/2118938407296454836", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "A computer scientist says California's results aren\u2019t just 64-35, it\u2019s even more unlikely: they're all 64.6 +/- 0.2, and 35.4 +/- 0.2. It looks like a corrupt programmer added a randomizing algorithm without realizing that, 